@server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Liveness Probe
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/health/live
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Readiness Probe
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### 3. General Health Check
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 4. User Login
# @name login
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@tenvora.internal",
  "password": "AdminPass123!"
}

### 5. Get Financial Overview (Requires Token)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Query Tenvora AI Copilot
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/ai/query
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What is my current safe to spend and tax reserve?"
}

### 7. Get Invoices List
GET {{server_HostAddress}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
